[{"title":"襄阳咏史 其三十六 冠盖里","author":"李俊民","text":"道口亭前多贵游，一时来往亦风流。\n若能共画安刘计，岂独英雄记里收。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1797,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"襄阳咏史 其三十七 呼鹰台","author":"李俊民","text":"英豪并起望人才，底事将军谩筑台。\n倘使曹公肉能饱，如何唤得野鹰来。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1798,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"襄阳咏史 其三十八 仲宣井","author":"李俊民","text":"试看汲古几何深，犹有馀波慰渴心。\n谁把石栏移便坐，并邻又得一繁钦。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1799,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"襄阳咏史 其三十九 兹楼","author":"李俊民","text":"见说襄阳有古风，可怜耆旧老无功。\n当年汉主龙兴地，尽在登楼四望中。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1800,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"襄阳咏史 其四十 堕泪碑","author":"李俊民","text":"愤深藉馆年年祭，痛切夷陵岁岁祠。\n不见征南遗爱地，至今泪堕岘山碑。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1801,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"襄阳咏史 其四十一 沈碑","author":"李俊民","text":"中原人物老书生，塞破乾坤万古名。\n俗子不知碑尚在，一朝南渡愧荒伧。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1802,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"襄阳咏史 其四十二 晋柏","author":"李俊民","text":"亭亭霜干上参天，色黛皮苍老更坚。\n当日不知谁手植，到今人与树千年。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1803,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"襄阳咏史 其四十三 文选楼","author":"李俊民","text":"朝朝暮暮蠹书鱼，选尽人閒得意书。\n常恐不能精此理，祗缘老杜近楼居。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1804,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"襄阳咏史 其四十四 解佩渚","author":"李俊民","text":"相遇江皋事颇奇，一双佩解去还遗。\n未能南国无游女，咏取周人汉广诗。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1805,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"襄阳咏史 其四十五 弄珠滩","author":"李俊民","text":"江沙一日蚌胎虚，游女争誇掌上珠。\n美化不将风俗禁，他年恐作媚川都。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1806,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"襄阳咏史 其四十六 金沙泉","author":"李俊民","text":"何处山泉味最佳，从来独说有金沙。\n楚人遍地宜城酒，莫著淄渑诳易牙。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1807,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"襄阳咏史 其四十七 涌月亭","author":"李俊民","text":"徘徊亭上晚相宜，月与高人本有期。\n不比寻常三五夜，十分圆后是来时。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1808,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 南游","author":"李俊民","text":"一片归心白羽轻，一场春梦不分明。\n东风二月淮阴郡，总是关山离别情。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1809,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 自遣","author":"李俊民","text":"南路蹉跎客未回，山桃野杏两三栽。\n逢春渐觉飘蓬苦，更向花前把一杯。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1810,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 雨后出郊","author":"李俊民","text":"柳塘烟起日西斜，马踏春泥半是花。\n何处最伤游客思，绿阴相閒两三家。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1811,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 寒食","author":"李俊民","text":"闲身行止属年华，故国春归未有涯。\n一树梨花一溪月，不知墙外是谁家。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1812,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 寒食席次","author":"李俊民","text":"鞦韆打困解罗裙，把酒相看日又曛。\n处士不知巫峡梦，春来犹见伴行云。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1813,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 郭外","author":"李俊民","text":"寒食悲看郭外春，数声鸦噪日将曛。\n山中旧宅无人住，一树繁花傍古坟。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1814,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 小桃","author":"李俊民","text":"桃花依旧笑春风，怅望无人此醉同。\n应是梦中飞作蝶，树头树底觅残红。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1815,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 看花","author":"李俊民","text":"两岸山花似雪开，开时莫放艳阳回。\n明朝携酒犹堪赏，雨涨春流隔往来。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1816,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 感花","author":"李俊民","text":"无人不道看花回，犹忆红螺一两杯。\n曾是管弦同醉伴，来时欢笑去时哀。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1817,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 其一 惜花","author":"李俊民","text":"花树流莺日过迟，少年争惜最红枝。\n何人尽得天生态，为报东风且莫吹。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1818,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 其二 惜花","author":"李俊民","text":"绣轭香鞯夜不归，看花只恐看来迟。\n今朝几许风吹落，多在青苔少在枝。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1819,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 暮春","author":"李俊民","text":"一年春色负归期，绿叶成阴子满枝。\n公子王孙莫来好，如今不似洛阳时。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1820,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 其一 送春","author":"李俊民","text":"可怜寥落送春心，负郭依山一径深。\n燕子不归花著雨，小溪犹忆去年寻。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1821,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 其二 送春","author":"李俊民","text":"二月已破三月来，常嗟物候暗相催。\n几时心绪浑无事，终日传杯不放杯。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1822,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 遗兴","author":"李俊民","text":"读彻闲书弄水回，绿杨移傍小庭栽。\n闭门尽日无人到，便有春光四面来。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1823,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 下楼","author":"李俊民","text":"绣帘珠户未曾开，却向春风领恨回。\n行到中庭数花朵，遥闻语笑自空来。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1824,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 招饮","author":"李俊民","text":"当时朝士已无多，故里心期柰别何。\n不用凭栏苦回首，且来花里听笙歌。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1825,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 春感","author":"李俊民","text":"岁岁无如老去何，东城南陌强经过。\n不知谁唱归春曲，断得人肠不在多。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1826,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 春怨","author":"李俊民","text":"已恨东风不展眉，落花惆怅满尘衣。\n与君试向江边觅，嬴得悽凉索漠归。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1827,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 约同归","author":"李俊民","text":"故国烟花想已残，浮生各自系悲欢。\n青山一道同云雨，步步相携不觉难。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1828,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 江村","author":"李俊民","text":"夜添山雨作江声，绿暗红藏江上村。\n何处人閒似仙境，寥寥一犬吠桃源。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1829,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 送客之江陵","author":"李俊民","text":"独上江楼思渺然，故人去后绝朱弦。\n西南一望和云水，入郭登桥出郭船。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1830,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 其一 赠别","author":"李俊民","text":"萧萧落叶送残秋，楼上黄昏欲望休。\n满目暮云风捲尽，亭亭孤月照行舟。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1831,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 其二 赠别","author":"李俊民","text":"洞庭风软荻花秋，客散江亭雨未休。\n南去北来人自老，此中离恨两难收。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1832,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 秋怀","author":"李俊民","text":"八月霜飞柳遍黄，鸟鸣山馆客思乡。\n十年马足知多少，地角天涯不是长。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1833,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 洛中","author":"李俊民","text":"洛阳犹自有残春，水北原南草色新。\n山酒一卮歌一曲，不能回避看花尘。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1834,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 洛中感旧","author":"李俊民","text":"千里江山一梦回，悔缘名利入尘埃。\n年光到处皆堪赏，谁与愁眉唱一杯。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1835,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 席上","author":"李俊民","text":"春风寂寞旆旌回，两度天涯地角来。\n重到笙歌分散地，与人头上拂尘埃。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1836,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 忆昔","author":"李俊民","text":"忆昔争游曲水滨，当轩下马入锦茵。\n如今不似时平日，风起杨花愁杀人。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1837,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 送客之荆南","author":"李俊民","text":"千山红树万山云，山鸟江枫得雨新。\n我自飘零是羁旅，不堪仍送故乡人。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1838,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 南征","author":"李俊民","text":"两行旌旆接扬州，烽火城西百尺楼。\n九姓如今尽臣妾，青天犹列旧旄头。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1839,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 其一 老将","author":"李俊民","text":"蓬根吹断雁南翔，晓鼓钟中两鬓霜。\n独倚关亭还把酒，不堪秋气入金疮。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1840,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 其二 老将","author":"李俊民","text":"怜君一见一悲歌，破虏曾轻马伏波。\n今日宝刀无杀气，太平功业在山河。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1841,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 其三 老将","author":"李俊民","text":"门前不改旧山河，泪落灯前一曲歌。\n更把玉鞭云外指，只缘君处受恩多。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1842,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 感征夫家","author":"李俊民","text":"臂上彫弓百战勋，居延城外又移军。\n不知万里沙场苦，犹自笙歌彻晓闻。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1843,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 从军","author":"李俊民","text":"万里还乡未到乡，受降城外月如霜。\n谁家营里吹羌笛，不是愁人也断肠。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1844,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 闻角","author":"李俊民","text":"铁马狐裘出汉营，瘴云深处守孤城。\n无端遇著场心事，鸣轧江楼角一声。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1845,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 闻笛","author":"李俊民","text":"山头烽火水边营，祇有牛羊与马群。\n羌笛何须怨杨柳，忍教呜咽夜长闻。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1846,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 汉女","author":"李俊民","text":"大边物色更无春，碧玉芳年事冠军。\n人世死前惟有别，阳台去作不归云。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1847,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 有别","author":"李俊民","text":"长对春风裛泪痕，殷红马上石榴裙。\n无端更唱关山曲，哀怨教人不忍闻。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1848,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 怨别","author":"李俊民","text":"书来未报几时还，终日昏昏醉梦閒。\n别易会难长自叹，不堪重过望夫山。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1849,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 寄远","author":"李俊民","text":"桃李年年上国新，单于鼓角隔山闻。\n一行书信千行泪，不是思君是恨君。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1850,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 其一 恨别","author":"李俊民","text":"悽悽长是别离情，冰簟银床梦不成。\n昨夜秋风今夜雨，篝灯愁泣到天明。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1851,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 其二 恨别","author":"李俊民","text":"君问归期未有期，迩来中酒起常迟。\n山长水远无消息，指点庭花又过时。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1852,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 其一 感旧","author":"李俊民","text":"流莺惊起不成栖，入到繁华梦觉时。\n人面只今何处在，魏公怀旧嫁文姬。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1853,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 其二 感旧","author":"李俊民","text":"碧栏干外绣帘垂，曾识云仙至小时。\n见我佯羞频点影，满头犹自插花枝。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1854,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 其三 感旧","author":"李俊民","text":"九陌初晴处处春，日高深院断无人。\n尊前花下长相见，宋玉东家是旧邻。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1855,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 代送别","author":"李俊民","text":"陇上流泉陇下分，目随征雁过寒云。\n人生适意无南北，莫向阳台梦使君。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1856,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 悼征妇","author":"李俊民","text":"万里行人尚未还，百年多在别离閒。\n当时惊觉高唐梦，为雨为云过别山。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1857,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 春夜","author":"李俊民","text":"春风二月落花时，忆得前年君寄诗。\n共道人家惆怅事，向灯弯尽一双眉。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1858,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 睡起","author":"李俊民","text":"万转千回懒下床，不辞鶗鴂妒年芳。\n酷怜一觉平明睡，枕破施朱隔宿妆。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1859,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 无睡","author":"李俊民","text":"江南江北望烟波，颦黛低红别怨多。\n尽日伤心人不见，卧来无睡欲如何。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1860,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 谩书","author":"李俊民","text":"已共红尘迹渐疏，画檐愁见燕归初。\n无端有寄闲消息，肠断萧娘一纸书。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1861,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 其一 寄情","author":"李俊民","text":"年光空感疾如流，同向春风各自愁。\n有境牵怀人不会，落花深处指青楼。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1862,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 其二 寄情","author":"李俊民","text":"曾留宋玉旧衣裳，云雨巫山枉断肠。\n不为傍人羞不起，夜来新惹桂枝香。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1863,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 其三 寄情","author":"李俊民","text":"寂寥满地落花红，独倚栏干花露中。\n征客未来音信断，年年回首泣春风。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1864,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 秋夜","author":"李俊民","text":"掷却风光忆少年，多生信有短因缘。\n欲知此恨无穷处，星落银河月半天。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1865,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 有感","author":"李俊民","text":"风轻帘幕燕争飞，到处烟花恨别离。\n倚柱寻思倍惆怅，映人匀却泪胭脂。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1866,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 戏荅","author":"李俊民","text":"公子王孙逐后尘，近来方解惜青春。\n春心不惬空归去，长伴吹萧别有人。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1867,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 其一 戏遣","author":"李俊民","text":"雨散云收一饷閒，不知何处入空山。\n慇勤好取襄王意，下蔡城危莫破颜。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1868,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 其二 戏遣","author":"李俊民","text":"枉破阳城十万家，门前初下七香车。\n自缘今日人心别，隔坐刚抛豆蔻花。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1869,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 其一 偶见","author":"李俊民","text":"莫愁还自有愁时，眉敛春山知为谁。\n含泪向人羞不语，芙蓉头上绾青丝。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1870,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"集古 其二 偶见","author":"李俊民","text":"满身花影倩人扶，清润潘郎玉不如。\n毕竟多情何处好，庾楼明月堕云初。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1871,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}}]